# The repository root isn't a colcon package. Without this file, colcon would take the top-level
# CMakeLists.txt for a plain CMake package, and since colcon doesn't look inside packages, it would
# never find the ament package in src/viam/trajex/moveit. Giving the root a type but no name keeps
# colcon from identifying it, so it keeps looking. Every colcon command will then warn that the root
# package is incomplete. The warning is harmless, and on balance that seems an acceptable trade-off
# for keeping the MoveIt specific parts in their own subtree.
type: none
